// Title: Potential Persistence Via VMwareToolBoxCmd.EXE VM State Change Script
// Rule ID: 7aa4e81a-a65c-4e10-9f81-b200eb229d7d
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
